      "cooked": "<p>In issue 5 of BbF, when Ra is crushed by the realization that he can’t get the Staff of Ra back, I really want Fanatic to roll her eyes and mutter “it’s always the staff …”</p>\n<p>(Yes I’m having her quote Buffy the Vampire Slayer, but BbF has her and Ra both quoting Monty Python, so I say my thing is okay.)</p>\n<p>The debate about mythology as non/fiction is a really deep quandary, and I’m glad that C&amp;A didn’t try to settle on a single answer.</p>\n<p>I like that Paul Bunyan and John Henry could both be dwarves.</p>\n<p>They say that the crappy original Ennead story is totally retconned, but I like to think it actually happened, was undone, and the reboot happened instead, because of La Capitana/Commodora.</p>",
